{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47975","headline":"赠雷殿直。 · 石恪","name":"赠雷殿直。","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衡阳去此正三年，一路程途甚坦然。\n深邃门墙三楚外，清风池馆五峰前。\n西边市井来商客，东岸汀洲簇钓船。\n公退只应无别事，朱陵後洞看神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石恪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}